 DemoTicker connected;F;vals;opts
 EWC.CONNECTED←connected
 ⎕PW←1000

⍝ Live ticker dashboard: a display-only Grid, an ApexChart, mover Labels and
⍝ a StatusBar all updating from one Timer — components composing into a
⍝ reactive UI. Starts paused with fixed seed prices so the idle frame is
⍝ deterministic; prices random-walk only while running.

 TK_SYM←'AAPL' 'DYAL' 'MSFT' 'GOOG' 'AMZN' 'TSLA'
 TK_P0←182.52 999 411.22 176.31 186.45 251.02
 TK_P←TK_P0
 TK_SERIES←60⍴(+/TK_P)÷6                    ⍝ index = mean price, last 60 ticks
 TK_TICKS←0

 F←'F1'
 F eWC'Form' 'Live Ticker'(50 50)(520 420)('Coord' 'Pixel')('BCol'(230 230 230))
 (F,'.TITLE')eWC'Label' 'Live market (demo data)'(12 12)(22 270)('CSS' 'font-size:15px;font-weight:bold')

⍝ Display-only grid: no Input/CellTypes, so per-tick Values pushes never
⍝ collide with an editor
 vals←⍉↑TK_SYM({(2⍕⍵)~' '}¨TK_P)(6⍴⊂'+0.00')(6⍴⊂'+0.00%')
 (F,'.G')eWC'Grid'('Posn'(45 10))('Size'(190 400))('Values' vals)('ColTitles'('Symbol' 'Price' 'Change' 'Chg%'))('TitleWidth' 0)('CellWidths'(100 100 100 97))

 (F,'.UP')eWC'Label' '▲ —'(245 10)(22 190)('FCol'(0 150 60))('CSS' 'font-size:14px;font-weight:bold')
 (F,'.DOWN')eWC'Label' '▼ —'(245 210)(22 190)('FCol'(190 30 30))('CSS' 'font-size:14px;font-weight:bold')

⍝ Chart animations must be off: ApexCharts would re-animate on every Series push
 opts←'{chart:{animations:{enabled:false},toolbar:{show:false}},xaxis:{labels:{show:false}},yaxis:{decimalsInFloat:2},stroke:{width:2}}'
 (F,'.CHART')eWC'ApexChart'(275 10)(170 400)TK_SERIES'line'('Options' opts)

 (F,'.RUN')eWC'Button' 'Run'(455 10)(24 60)('Style' 'Check')('Event' 'Select' 'CBTicker')
 (F,'.RESET')eWC'Button' 'Reset'(455 85)(24 60)('Event' 'Select' 'CBTicker')

 (F,'.SB')eWC'StatusBar'('BCol'(245 245 245))
 (F,'.SB.S1')eWC'StatusField' 'Ticks: ' '0'

 (F,'.TICK')eWC'Timer' 500 ('Active' 0)('Event' 'Timer' 'CBTicker')('FireOnce' 0)
